<section xmlns:image="http://ez.no/namespaces/ezpublish3/image/" xmlns:custom="http://ez.no/namespaces/ezpublish3/custom/" xmlns:xhtml="http://ez.no/namespaces/ezpublish3/xhtml/"><section><section><header>INGREDIENTS</header><ul><li><paragraph>85g / 3 ounces organic baby spinach</paragraph></li><li><paragraph>709 / 2 large oranges, peeled and quartered</paragraph></li><li><paragraph>365g / 2 medium bananas</paragraph></li><li><paragraph>121g / 1 cup raspberries</paragraph></li><li><paragraph>½ cup crushed ice</paragraph></li><li><paragraph>79ml / ⅓ cup mango juice concentrate</paragraph></li></ul><header>PREPARATION</header><ol><li><paragraph>Place all ingredients in a large blender or a food processor fitted with a steel blade. Process until smooth.</paragraph></li><li><paragraph>Serve in a glass. Drink. Go be awesome.</paragraph></li></ol><paragraph><emphasize>Recipe credit: <link url_id="23">Credit Name</link> / <link url_id="41">CC BY</link></emphasize><line/><line/><emphasize>Photo credit: <link url_id="23">Credit Name</link> / <link url_id="41">CC BY</link></emphasize><line/></paragraph></section></section></section>